# 7. Important Functions

| Function | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `newNode()` | Creates a RED node |
| `insert()` | Performs BST insertion |
| `fixInsert()` | Repairs Red-Black violations |
| `leftRotate()` | Performs left rotation |
| `rightRotate()` | Performs right rotation |
| `inorder()` | Displays the tree |

### Most important function

```c
fixInsert()
```

It handles:

```text
RED + RED
   ↓
Check Uncle
   ↓
RED uncle → Recolor
BLACK uncle → Rotation + Recolor
```

